title: $:/plugins/wikilabs/devtools/history


V 0.7.0 - 2026.09.17

* Source position tracking now also records which variable produced a subtree, and its line helpers moved to `utils.js` so other plugins can share them.

V 0.6.1 - 2026.05.09

* Fix startup ordering so `$tw.popup` exists when the click-handler runs (regression exposed by TW core PR #9305).

V 0.6.0 - 2026.04.10

* Rename DOM attributes: `data-source-pos` → `data-pos`, `data-source-start`+`data-source-end` → `data-range`, `data-source-context` → `data-ctx`, `data-source-caller` → `data-caller`

V 0.5.0 - 2026.03.31

* initial release
* name: devtools
